DTSTAMP:20260802T111854Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260802
SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] Uniform Deadlines for Rate\, Form\, and QHP F
 ilings for Non-Grandfathered Individual and Small Group Health Plans Wit
 h Effective Dates of Coverage During 2026
DESCRIPTION:https://www.maine.gov/pfr/insurance/sites/maine.gov.pfr.insura
 nce/files/inline-files/484.pdf
URL:https://www.maine.gov/pfr/insurance/sites/maine.gov.pfr.insurance/file
